{
  "$comment": "Projection of the pinned VMware Cloud Foundation 9.0.0.0 SDDC Manager OpenAPI specification. Provenance is recorded in docs/official_sources.json. This file is protected; it is the authority for every request the acceptance harness inspects.",
  "source": {
